<title>USA: Salomon Brothers names new chief economist.</title>
<headline>Salomon Brothers names new chief economist.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers Inc on Monday said it has named Kermit Schoenholtz as its new chief economist and head of global economic and market analysis, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Schoenholtz, who will be based in London, will have the responsibility of directing Salomon's team of economists in New York, London, Tokyo and Hong Kong.</p>
